### Lime EOL Registry — manual requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Postman users: see docs/postman/

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = paste-a-dev-login-token-here

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### OpenAPI document
GET http://localhost:3000/api/docs-json

### Dev login (Phase 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@linearsix.com",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Current user (Phase 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
